<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt to release DEFU on December 2.</title>
<headline>NZ govt to release DEFU on December 2.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Finance Minister Bill Birch said on Tuesday that the December Economic and Fiscal Update would be released on December 2 at 4 p.m.  </p>
<p>A lock-up for journalists and analysts will be held from 3 p.m. on the day of the release.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
